    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead your squad to victory in <i>Tactical Battles</i>, a fast-paced turn-based strategy RPG packed with clever mechanics, surprising twists, and limitless possibilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the battlefield with deep tactical options and character progression that rewards creativity and risk-taking. Upgrade classes, command your team, and shape the fight with every move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Farm infinite extra attacks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Steal powerful attack skills and abilities</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Complete quests and mini-games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Manipulate elemental terrain &amp; status effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf09 <strong>Build bridges</strong>\u00a0:move safely through dangerous zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Upgrade your class</strong> to unlock devastating new skills and dramatically boost your stats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to outsmart the enemy, upgrade your hero, and take on the ultimate Tactical Battle?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead your squad to victory in <i>Tactical Battles</i>, a fast-paced turn-based strategy RPG packed with clever mechanics, surprising twists, and limitless possibilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the battlefield with deep tactical options and character progression that rewards creativity and risk-taking. Upgrade classes, command your team, and shape the fight with every move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Farm infinite extra attacks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Steal powerful attack skills and abilities</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Complete quests and mini-games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Manipulate elemental terrain &amp; status effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf09 <strong>Build bridges</strong>\u00a0:move safely through dangerous zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Upgrade your class</strong> to unlock devastating new skills and dramatically boost your stats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to outsmart the enemy, upgrade your hero, and take on the ultimate Tactical Battle?</p>",
    "short_description": "Tactical Battle is a turn-based RPG where knights, wizards, dragons, and quirky classes like Father Nature clash in strategic combat. Assemble your team, master unique skills and perks, and prepare for an epic showdown against the Devil boss in a world filled with fantasy and challenge.",
